        <mxCell id="legend_flow" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F7FA;strokeColor=#C6CDD6;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#3B4552;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Request &amp;amp; Deployment Flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;① DNS resolution (Route 53)&lt;br/&gt;② CloudFront + WAF at the edge&amp;#10;(see detail tab)&lt;br/&gt;③ Static assets from S3;&amp;#10;/api/* forwarded to ALB&lt;br/&gt;④ ALB routes to EKS pods&lt;br/&gt;⑤ App reads/writes RDS (Multi-AZ)&lt;br/&gt;⑥ CI builds image → pushes to ECR&lt;br/&gt;⑦ CI/CD assumes role via OIDC&lt;br/&gt;⑧ Terraform provisions AWS infra&lt;br/&gt;⑨ Helm deploys workloads to EKS" vertex="1">
